      "content": "LiquidCrystal_I2C lcd(0x27, 16, 2);\nint secs = 0;\nvoid setup() { lcd.init(); lcd.backlight(); lcd.print(\"Hello, IoT Sim!\"); }\nvoid loop() { secs += 1; lcd.clear(); lcd.print(\"Uptime s: \"); lcd.print(secs); delay(1000); }\n"
